  "step_3": "The decision reason requires comparing the probability of the maximum outcome and preferring the lottery with the higher such probability. However, the individual did not consider or reference the probability of the maximum outcome at all. Instead, they perceived no significant difference between the lotteries, suggesting a lack of focus on any quantitative comparison of outcomes or probabilities. Therefore, the individual did not apply the decision reason. The justification provided is inconsistent with the rule of the decision reason. The absence of any mention of probabilities or maximum outcomes in the reasoning process strongly indicates that the reason was not used.",
